  {
    "title": "API, data and design",
    "body": "**API:** services call `notify(eventId, userId, type)`; users change settings through a preferences API. **Data:** preferences per user, channel and category, with quiet hours; `sent(notification key, status)` with the key as primary key; device tokens and addresses. **High-level design:** events arrive on a queue with at-least-once delivery; notification workers read preferences, record the key, and put each message on a queue per channel and priority; a pacer per provider sends to the provider.",
