    "title": "Quotas and priority",
    "body": "The email pacer sends at most **1,000 per second**, counting retries (SD 17). It always takes transactional messages first and keeps **200 per second** for them; the campaign uses the other 800, about 10,000,000 ÷ 800 = 12,500 seconds, about 3.5 hours. An order update never waits behind the campaign, so it arrives within the minute. When transactional traffic is low, the campaign may use the spare room.",
